lped this little salon and its clients reach so many more people.We're feeling the pressure, and we're more motivated than ever! Thank you for giving this little salon so much love. The full game is in the works, and we can’t wait for you to discover more of these st","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T11:02:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114032180","verified_at":"2026-10-22T14:43:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4093320-1846651706693569","game_id":"steam-4093320","kind":"announcement","title":"Beastfolk Barber joins Steam Next Fest: Your turn with the scissors!","summary":"Me getting a haircut: “Whatever you think looks good.” Also me: (knows exactly what I don't want) This time, you're the one holding the scissors in Beastfolk Barber. ✂️ Chat with your customers about their lives, tidy up their hair, and get to know their stories through what they say and how they react. We're taking part in October Steam Next Fest! The free demo is available now, so come meet the fluffy customers on the other side of the mirror. 🐱🐰 Every customer brings a little of their life to","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T03:39:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706693569","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4093320-1845383656393054","game_id":"steam-4093320","kind":"announcement","title":"Time to Break Out the Confetti!🙌","summary":"The Beastfolk Barber demo hit 1,000+ Steam reviews, with 99% positive and Overwhelmingly Positive! 🎉 Seeing you call the characters cute and give the art so much love has us grinning. We’re about ready to break out the confetti in the shop! Thanks for stopping by, giving the demo a try, and leaving your thoughts. It means a lot to the team. Know a friend who’d feel right at home here? Invite them over! We’ll keep working hard, and we’re glad to have you along. Your next customer is waiting. Try ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-05T10:14:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656393054","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4093320-1840310314342652","game_id":"steam-4093320","kind":"announcement","title":"Our Doors Are Open! The Beastfolk Barber Demo Is Out Now","summary":"Hi everyone,We can finally share the news: the free Beastfolk Barber demo is out now! ✂️Our little barber shop is ready to welcome its first customers, and we’ve also released a brand-new trailer to mark the occasion.In Beastfolk Barber, a haircut is more than a change in style. It’s also how you begin to know each customer.Between every snip and conversation, you’ll hear about their worries, their hopes, and the things they haven’t been able to say out loud.Every fluffy customer who sits in you","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-06T17:12:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314342652","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4093320-1834602721195326","game_id":"steam-4093320","kind":"announcement","title":"Beastfolk Barber - Official Reveal Trailer","summary":"Hey there,Project Salon is now officially titled Beastfolk Barber.We’re thrilled to share that Beastfolk Barber has officially made its debut at the global games showcase Summer Game Fest, with its first trailer premiering during the official featured showcase Wholesome Direct.A snip here, a story there. Nowhere's more honest than the barber's chair.You're a barber in a city full of beastfolk. Chat with your customers, style their look, help them see something new in the mirror... and in themsel","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-07T06:03:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721195326","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4093320":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:24:09Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:24:08Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4093320":"2026-10-26T11:24:09Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4093320":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:24:08Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:24:08Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:24:08Z"},"4920000":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:24:09Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:24:09Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:24:09Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4093320","app_id":4093320,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:27Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"192c5c14ee8653adf3401e87d3a7354d08f835c9ea42759c6ba9761b22e71191","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"수인들이 살아가는 도시에서 작은 이발소를 운영해 보세요. 손님들과 이야기를 나누고, 어울리는 스타일을 찾아주며, 거울 속에서 새로운 모습과 새로운 자신을 발견하도록 도와주세요.","publishers":[{"name":"SIGONO INC.","creator_clan_account_id":33066045}],"developers":[{"name":"Safe Flight Games","creator_clan_account_id":45638144},{"name":"GameWorks"}]},"release":{"is_coming_soon":true,"custom_release_date_message":"발표 예정","coming_soon_display":"text_tba"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name"